Count How Many Times 25H Occurs in a
Block

LXI H, 2050H ; HL → start of block
MVI B, 05H ; 5 numbers total
MVI C, 00H ; Occurrence count = 0
LOOP:
MOV A, M ; Load current value into A
CPI 25H ; Compare A with 25H
JNZ NOT_FOUND ; If A ≠ 25H, skip
INR C ; A = 25H, increment count
NOT_FOUND:
INX H ; Advance pointer
DCR B ; Decrement total counter
JNZ LOOP ; Repeat for all elements
MOV A, C ; A = number of occurrences
HLT
